completed_at: "2026-10-12T15:05:09.977Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: Reproduce in an isolated initialized tracker with unchanged-byte refusal evidence; align external-reference mutation support with public SDK contracts; generated help/contracts and actual dispatch agree; a negative control detects ghost recovery flags; all reserved-field recovery recommendations use declared executable paths
goal: project management = context management
parent: pm-wg07
risk: low
confidence: high
resolution: "Resolve reserved-core-field recovery only from executable mutation registrations, sharing collection aliases with structured item IO and declining absent external-reference flags."
expected_result: Each reserved-field refusal names a declared mutation route or explicitly states that no create/update flag exists.
actual_result: "Independent ghost-flag control fails before the repair; the 73-field census, collection alias checks, stdin unchanged-byte refusals and structured mutations pass. Exact hosted coverage, static and native Windows regression contexts pass on 7411d7ee6."
